Package: seurust
Title: 'Rust' Native Kernels for 'Seurat'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Nebil", family = "Ibrahim",
           email = "nebil080298@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Rahul", family = "Satija",
           role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original Seurat native APIs"),
    person("Satija Lab and Collaborators",
           role = "cph",
           comment = "Original Seurat / ModularityOptimizer code")
    )
Description: Provides 'Rust' implementations of performance-critical 'Seurat'
    native routines such as log-normalization, sparse row scaling, shared
    nearest-neighbor graph construction, SCTransform residuals, Gram-matrix
    PCA, and integration helpers. Install alongside 'Seurat' (>= 5.6.0) to
    use the same function signatures with a 'Rust' backend. The interfaces follow the original 'Seurat' package by the
    Satija Lab and collaborators (MIT license; <https://satijalab.org/seurat>).
    Builds require 'Cargo' and 'rustc' (>= 1.81); source builds include
    offline crate sources under 'src/rust'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
